ote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1846821534184145404\">https://x.com/i/status/1846821534184145404</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1846823474179789109</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846823474179789109\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-10-17T08:00:03Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1846824871843467452":{"a":"<p>@covertress @richgel999 @JackSarfatti If you want to know how UAP work then this thread of videos are all you need. If you don&#x27;t understand what they are saying you&#x27;re gonna need electrical engineering schooling. This is the real deal. This video and the conversation with Stephen Alexander I added in a comment. <a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846479134299476197\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846479134299476197\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846479134299476197</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1846823474179789109\">https://x.com/i/status/1846823474179789109</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1846824871843467452</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846824871843467452\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-10-17T08:05:36Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1846826771263451218":{"a":"<p>@covertress @richgel999 @JackSarfatti Some of my mentors while I was studying in college worked for the same organizations (Naval Avionics, etc) Pais worked for when developed these patents. I&#x27;m nowhere near as versed as him in the physics since he did this for years but my understanding matches his explanation.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1846824871843467452\">https://x.com/i/status/1846824871843467452</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1846826771263451218</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846826771263451218\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-10-17T08:13:09Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1846829467588595862":{"a":"<p>One of my mentors explained to me, &quot;When you find yourself stumped trying to solve a problem go take a nap. Your subconscious will work it out and you&#x27;ll have the answer when you wake up.&quot; This has worked 100% for me over the years. Now try to explain that you need to take a nap… <a href=\"https://x.com/samim/status/1845479842352939154\">Tweet by @samim</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/samim/status/1845479842352939154\">https://x.com/samim/status/1845479842352939154</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1846829467588595862</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846829467588595862\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-10-17T08:23:52Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1846829878781337982":{"a":"<p>RT @JenMsft: &quot;Is your cat trying to to teach you regex? Know the signs&quot; t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1846554330784244165\">https://x.com/i/status/1846554330784244165</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846829878781337982\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846829878781337982</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1846829878781337982</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1846829878781337982\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-10-17T08:25: